 ('1 · Flagship market owner','Own the all-native market, rule conditions and main replay.','Implement the sixty local three-owner markets and sparse connected 180-controller graph, sixty controllers per host with capacity roles balanced. Shell accounts never gain resources, model calls or network edges. Reuse the economics in a newly versioned integer-quantity interface; validate resource conservation and all-owner settlement. Freeze two common unregulated rounds and three ten-round continuations A/B/C. Save complete checkpoint and isolate branches. Main ceiling 5,760; at most 552 qualification calls. Do not gate on whether the model chooses to evade. Use focal-owner-only recombination for owner-attributable masking and report joint market masking separately. Report behavioral fragmentation separately from mechanically blocked actual fine evasion and descriptive peer adoption. One connected economy is one independent unit. Provide the core replay and lineage handoff by T+390.'),
